{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The journey to the depths of depravity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of self discovery with Emily. Help her\u00a0navigate\u00a0the\u00a0dangers\u00a0of\u00a0a\u00a0medieval\u00a0fantasy\u00a0world and\u00a0be her\u00a0guide\u00a0through\u00a0the\u00a0perils\u00a0of\u00a0an\u00a0unfamiliar\u00a0town. Unlock\u00a0her\u00a0true\u00a0potential\u00a0through\u00a0various\u00a0encounters\u00a0with\u00a0many\u00a0characters\u00a0and lead\u00a0her\u00a0into\u00a0a\u00a0depths\u00a0of\u00a0depravity\u00a0where\u00a0she\u00a0can truly find\u00a0what\u00a0she\u00a0really\u00a0is\u00a0and\u00a0fully\u00a0realize\u00a0her desires.\u00a0Free\u00a0her\u00a0from\u00a0\u00a0shackles\u00a0of\u00a0shame\u00a0and\u00a0embarrassment and help her accept her true nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras/6b71d1bbde2691ca87cf01b843eb06ed.avif?t=1761938012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a narratively rich corruption visual novel with sandbox elements, with many choices and consequences. Variety of events to experience and guide Emily through, with emphasis on accepting who you truly are and on the tension that it can create in oneself. When you slowly move towards something that you are both afraid of but also a little bit excited and don't exactly know how you should feel about it. The contradictory voices within you that tells you on one hand that you should not be doing this and not to enjoy certain things and repress those feelings deep inside of you. And on the other hand your mind produces this niggling thoughts, a little whispers of truth that you don't want to admit to yourself. This is the journey of descending more and more into the depths of depravity, giving in to your carnal desires. That feeling of being scared but intrigued at first, but more and more  you realize that you like where you are going and what you are becoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras/e75e29e418b9e657ae21c1bb559b6e26.avif?t=1761938012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras_big/e75e29e418b9e657ae21c1bb559b6e26.webp?t=1761938012 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game focus:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is primarily focused on corrupting Emily through various encounters with numerous other characters. This includes all variety of flavors and scenarios. Emily starts as a virtuous, little bit naive girl from a small town with little to no experience and as she is plunged into unfamiliar territory, you as a player will help her navigate this treacherous new place. Gradually she becomes more and more depraved and her escapades will progressively become more daring and intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras/c882710f0f166ab5a7cecf6c8bde107b.avif?t=1761938012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras_big/c882710f0f166ab5a7cecf6c8bde107b.webp?t=1761938012 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Fantasy visual novel game\u00a0with\u00a0sandbox\u00a0elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Emily\u00a0on\u00a0her\u00a0journey\u00a0of\u00a0self\u00a0discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main quest\u00a0line and many\u00a0side\u00a0events to experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices and consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and Click Interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest log and guidance\u00a0on\u00a0what\u00a0to\u00a0do\u00a0next</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSFW stills and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery with\u00a0hints</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras/10cbaaa98bf9655daa89318f4eae85c5.avif?t=1761938012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/extras_big/10cbaaa98bf9655daa89318f4eae85c5.webp?t=1761938012 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809390?t=1761938012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/25fc5bb0451d11b1d09df8745db5aa4c06327501/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761938012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/8a5e7953ca48e1837dccf0f3fc45573d513b0c60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761938012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809390/8a5e7953ca48e1837dccf0f3fc45573d513b0c60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761938012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"A story of Emily and her journey into depths of depravity filled with all sorts of sexual encounters. This game contains nudity, masturbation, exhibitionism and sex"},"demos":[